  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Trying to shoot thirty-two videos on a nonstop studio loop, Muranishi wraps one scene after another—and when his lead actor needs thirty minutes to recover, Muranishi drafts shy assistant Student right onto the set.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "はい、頑張ってね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "はいカット！ナイスです、すばらしい！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "あなた表情パーフェクト、あなたタイミング完璧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "次、和室いきます！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "設定聞いてる？団地妻やめる、教師だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "すいません、カメラ回ってます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "はーい、カット！すばらしかったぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "あの、三十ぷんください。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "遅い！シャワーを浴びてこい、二分後に撮影するぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "えっ？いや、あの…",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "お前が男優をやるんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "一生に一度しか作れない作品だ、俺が撮ってやる！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "はい、頑張ってね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Here is your fee—keep up the great work.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "はいカット！ナイスです、すばらしい！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'All right, cut! Nice work, truly wonderful!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "あなた表情パーフェクト、あなたタイミング完璧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Your facial expression was perfect, and your timing was spot on.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "次、和室いきます！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Next scene, moving to the Japanese tatami room!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "設定聞いてる？団地妻やめる、教師だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Did you hear the character setup? Scrap housewife—you are a schoolteacher.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "すいません、カメラ回ってます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Quiet please, the camera is rolling.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "はーい、カット！すばらしかったぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'All right, cut! That was magnificent.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "あの、三十ぷんください。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Um, please give me thirty minutes to rest.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "遅い！シャワーを浴びてこい、二分後に撮影するぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Too slow! Go take a shower, we roll in two minutes.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "えっ？いや、あの…",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What? Wait, hold on...'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "お前が男優をやるんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You are stepping in as the male actor.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "一生に一度しか作れない作品だ、俺が撮ってやる！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This is a film you can make only once in a lifetime—I will shoot it myself!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
